  "goodToKnow": "Der Totalschaden is a write-off: a vehicle destroyed beyond repair (technischer Totalschaden) or whose repair would cost more than it's worth (wirtschaftlicher Totalschaden). The insurer then pays the Wiederbeschaffungswert (replacement value) minus the Restwert. Jokingly, people also call a disastrous event or person ein Totalschaden. Plural: die Totalschäden."
